#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Introduction to using simulators for testing and debugging quantum circuits "
"in Qiskit."
msgstr ""
"Panimula sa paggamit ng mga simulator para sa pagsubok at pag-debug ng mga "
"quantum circuit sa Qiskit."

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Introduction"
msgstr "Panimula"

#. type: Title #
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Introduction {#introduction}"
msgstr "Panimula {#introduction}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"You can test your quantum programs by running them on simulated devices and "
"exploring their performance under realistic device noise models. This allows"
" you to debug them before sending them to a quantum processing unit (QPU).\n"
msgstr ""
"Maaari mong subukan ang iyong mga quantum program sa pamamagitan ng "
"pagpapatakbo ng mga ito sa mga simulated na device at pagtuklas ng kanilang "
"performance sa ilalim ng mga makatotohanang device noise model. Nagbibigay-"
"daan ito sa iyo na i-debug ang mga ito bago ipadala sa isang quantum "
"processing unit (QPU).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Quantum simulators can be used to help develop and test programs before "
"fine-tuning them and sending them to quantum hardware. Local simulators can "
"do this with good performance and efficiency.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ang mga quantum simulator ay maaaring gamitin upang tulungang mapaunlad at "
"masubukan ang mga program bago i-fine-tune ang mga ito at ipadala sa quantum"
" hardware. Ang mga lokal na simulator ay kayang gawin ito nang may magandang"
" performance at kahusayan.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Because the cost of classically simulating quantum circuits scales "
"exponentially with the number of qubits, circuits that are larger than 50 "
"qubits or so generally cannot run on simulators. For such circuits, you "
"can:\n"
msgstr ""
"Dahil ang gastos ng classical simulation ng mga quantum circuit ay lumalaki "
"nang exponential kasabay ng bilang ng mga qubit, ang mga circuit na mas "
"malaki sa humigit-kumulang 50 qubit ay karaniwang hindi maaaring patakbuhin "
"sa mga simulator. Para sa mga ganitong circuit, maaari kang:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Test smaller versions of the circuits that can be simulated classically.\n"
msgstr ""
"Subukan ang mas maliliit na bersyon ng mga circuit na maaaring i-simulate "
"nang klasikal.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Modify the circuits so that they become classically simulable, although less"
" accurate.\n"
msgstr ""
"Baguhin ang mga circuit upang maging klasikal na masi-simulate ang mga ito, "
"kahit hindi gaanong tumpak.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Stabilizer circuits, also known as Clifford circuits, are a useful tool for "
"accomplishing this latter goal. These are a restricted class of quantum "
"circuits that can be efficiently simulated classically. Specialized "
"simulators can easily simulate stabilizer circuits with thousands of qubits."
" See [Efficient simulation of stabilizer circuits with Qiskit Aer "
"primitives](/guides/simulate-stabilizer-circuits) for more information.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ang mga stabilizer circuit, na kilala rin bilang Clifford circuit, ay isang "
"kapaki-pakinabang na kasangkapan para matupad ang huling layuning ito. Ang "
"mga ito ay isang limitadong klase ng mga quantum circuit na maaaring mahusay"
" na i-simulate nang klasikal. Ang mga espesyalisadong simulator ay madaling "
"maka-simulate ng mga stabilizer circuit na may libu-libong qubit. Tingnan "
"ang [Efficient simulation of stabilizer circuits with Qiskit Aer "
"primitives](/guides/simulate-stabilizer-circuits) para sa karagdagang "
"impormasyon.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"For general quantum circuits, the following tools are available to test and "
"debug your quantum programs:\n"
msgstr ""
"Para sa mga pangkalahatang quantum circuit, ang mga sumusunod na kasangkapan"
" ay available upang masubukan at ma-debug ang iyong mga quantum program:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"For exact simulation of small quantum circuits, you can use the reference "
"primitives included with Qiskit. See [Exact simulation with Qiskit "
"primitives](/guides/simulate-with-qiskit-sdk-primitives).\n"
msgstr ""
"Para sa eksaktong simulation ng maliliit na quantum circuit, maaari mong "
"gamitin ang mga reference primitive na kasama ng Qiskit. Tingnan ang [Exact "
"simulation with Qiskit primitives](/guides/simulate-with-qiskit-sdk-"
"primitives).\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"For higher-performance simulation that can handle larger circuits, or to "
"incorporate noise models into your simulation, use [Qiskit "
"Aer](https://qiskit.org/ecosystem/aer/), a project that is part of the "
"[Qiskit Ecosystem](https://qiskit.github.io/ecosystem/). See [Exact and "
"noisy simulation with Qiskit Aer primitives](simulate-with-qiskit-aer).\n"
msgstr ""
"Para sa mas mataas na performance na simulation na kayang humawak ng mas "
"malalaking circuit, o para isama ang mga noise model sa iyong simulation, "
"gamitin ang [Qiskit Aer](https://qiskit.org/ecosystem/aer/), isang proyekto "
"na bahagi ng [Qiskit Ecosystem](https://qiskit.github.io/ecosystem/). "
"Tingnan ang [Exact and noisy simulation with Qiskit Aer "
"primitives](simulate-with-qiskit-aer).\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"To build custom noise models, use the "
"[`noise`](https://qiskit.org/ecosystem/aer/apidocs/aer_noise.html) module of"
" Qiskit Aer. See [Building noise models](/guides/build-noise-models).\n"
msgstr ""
"Para bumuo ng mga custom na noise model, gamitin ang "
"[`noise`](https://qiskit.org/ecosystem/aer/apidocs/aer_noise.html) module ng"
" Qiskit Aer. Tingnan ang [Building noise models](/guides/build-noise-"
"models).\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Hardware considerations {#hardware-considerations}"
msgstr "Mga konsiderasyon sa hardware {#hardware-considerations}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Several factors impact how much memory quantum simulation requires, so there"
" are no exact hardware requirements for simulation, but there are some "
"guidelines you can follow.\n"
msgstr ""
"Maraming salik ang nakakaapekto sa kung gaano karaming memorya ang kailangan"
" ng quantum simulation, kaya walang eksaktong mga hardware requirement para "
"sa simulation, ngunit may mga alituntunin na maaari mong sundin.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The only requirement to run Qiskit is a functioning Python environment.  For"
" details, see the [Operating system support](/guides/install-"
"qiskit#operating-system-support) section.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ang tanging kinakailangan para patakbuhin ang Qiskit ay isang gumaganang "
"Python environment. Para sa mga detalye, tingnan ang seksyong [Operating "
"system support](/guides/install-qiskit#operating-system-support).\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Because the requirements for simulating quantum circuits scale exponentially"
" with the number of qubits, the available hardware limits the number of "
"qubits that can be simulated. For example, a system with 4GB RAM can "
"simulate approximately 27 qubits.\n"
msgstr ""
"Dahil ang mga kinakailangan para sa pag-simulate ng mga quantum circuit ay "
"lumalaki nang exponential kasabay ng bilang ng mga qubit, ang available na "
"hardware ay nagtatakda ng limitasyon sa bilang ng mga qubit na maaaring "
"i-simulate. Halimbawa, ang isang sistema na may 4GB RAM ay kayang i-simulate"
" ang humigit-kumulang 27 qubit.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"More or less available memory will not result in more or less accurate "
"results (assuming results are returned), although more memory might return "
"results faster or let you simulate more qubits.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ang mas marami o mas kaunting available na memorya ay hindi magreresulta sa "
"mas tumpak o mas hindi tumpak na mga resulta (kung ipagpalagay na naibabalik"
" ang mga resulta), kahit na ang mas maraming memorya ay maaaring magbalik ng"
" mga resulta nang mas mabilis o hayaan kang mag-simulate ng mas maraming "
"qubit.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"To get the most benefit out of your hardware, use local stabilizer "
"(Clifford) circuit simulation when possible.  See [Clifford simulation with "
"Qiskit Runtime local testing mode](local-testing-mode#clifford-simulation) "
"or [Efficient simulation of stabilizer circuits with Qiskit Aer "
"primitives](/guides/simulate-stabilizer-circuits) for examples.\n"
msgstr ""
"Para mapakinabangan nang husto ang iyong hardware, gamitin ang lokal na "
"stabilizer (Clifford) circuit simulation kung posible. Tingnan ang [Clifford"
" simulation with Qiskit Runtime local testing mode](local-testing-"
"mode#clifford-simulation) o [Efficient simulation of stabilizer circuits "
"with Qiskit Aer primitives](/guides/simulate-stabilizer-circuits) para sa "
"mga halimbawa.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"You can increase your computing power by following these instructions to "
"[run with multiple GPUs, nodes, or both](https://qiskit.github.io/qiskit-"
"aer/howtos/running_gpu.html).\n"
msgstr ""
"Maaari mong dagdagan ang iyong computing power sa pamamagitan ng pagsunod sa"
" mga tagubilin na ito para [patakbuhin gamit ang maraming GPU, node, o "
"pareho](https://qiskit.github.io/qiskit-aer/howtos/running_gpu.html).\n"

